  "notes": "Phanpy Mastodon client. Single narrow column, very rounded (32px) post cards; no per-post action bar - actions hide behind ... menu, with tiny colored state icons (heart liked, rocket boosted, bookmark saved) pinned at card top-right. Boosted posts get a faint purple/pink corner gradient with rocket icon and booster avatar line. Threads render as grouped units with 1/X numbering badges and a vertical connector line; reply chains show the parent excerpt. Alt text displayed as small gray captions under images; multi-image posts in a 2x2 grid with ALT buttons. Filtered posts collapse to one line with FILTERED tag. Bottom of timeline reads 'The end.'. Floating round compose FAB (bluish, feather icon) - no codebook entry for FAB. Lower cards are lazy-rendered blanks in the capture."
